    # label's top rule) filled four cells on the original PDF and five once
    # macOS had re-paginated it to A4, and two lines of two-column text
    # spanned the grid like a rule did. At pixel level the rule is one row
    # that reaches across; text is five or more and the grey band is not dark.
    "CUTLINE_MAX_THICK_FRAC": "0.003",
